                <invention-title lang="de">VERZÖGERTE BEREITSTELLUNG EINER REKONFIGURATIONSNACHRICHT IN EINEM INTEGRIERTEN ZUGANGS- UND BACKHAUL (IAB)-NETZWERK</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">DISTRIBUTION RETARDÉE DE MESSAGE DE RECONFIGURATION DANS UN RÉSEAU D'ACCÈS ET DE LIAISON TERRESTRE INTÉGRÉ (IAB)</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">DELAYED DELIVERY OF RECONFIGURATION MESSAGE IN INTEGRATED ACCESS AND BACKHAUL (IAB) NETWORK</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method for integrated access and backhaul network (LAB) node migration, performed at a first IAB node, comprising: receiving a first configuration message over a source path with a first IAB donor via a first distributed unit of the first IAB donor, the configuration message comprising a radio resource control (RRC) message providing an uplink (UL) mapping or an Internet Protocol (IP) address for communicating with a target donor; receiving a trigger on the source path; and delivering the first configuration message to the second node in response to the trigger.</p>
            </abstract>
